    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start the process, begin by checking if the order has been received."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the sum of the order is less than 500, then continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "However, if the sum of the order is greater than 2000, compute a discount of 4%."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the sum of the order falls between 1000 and 1500, compute a discount of 3%."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "Similarly, if the sum of the order falls between 500 and 999, compute a discount of 2%."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "Finally, create the bill and the process will come to an end."
    }
